refactor: rename to ludus + P1 (Resource/State/Dialogue v3)

Rename GameLib -> ludus across package name, README, AGENTS, and docs.

Resource v3:
- Resource implements ValueSource<number>; addModifier copies input (no caller mutation)
- subscribeChange/onThreshold return unsubscribe; ResourceRegistry replaces ResourceManager
- validation (min>max/NaN/Infinity); versioned snapshot; drop flat/percent dead modifiers

State v3:
- StateMachine<TContext> (conditions/transitions/temporary state/events) + VisualStateMap
- remove StateSprite/LayeredStateSprite and fake draw/loadImage/preloadImages
- updateContext reverts to initial state when no condition matches

Dialogue v3:
- DialogueDefinition<TContext> + DialogueSession<TContext>; choice ids (not 1-based)
- selectLine + formatDialogueText replace DialogueLibrary; drop Lua truthiness/array DSL
